            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.13.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 13.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.25.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "25.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.19.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 19.26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omundu ooli nabio, akhatasibwe bikali, ne omundu ooli busa, naye akhanuulwe aakhaba sitiiti nisio ali nasio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lukano khu lumiicho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu achiililila khuloma ali, “Bubwami bwa Wele buli nga lukano luno, omundu amiicha bumiicho mu mukuunda kwewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siilo akona, enyokha ne busiele, mala nga akhola ario aba bumiicho bulikho busekesa, ne niye se amanyakho nga busekesa tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Liloba liliene likhola bimelwa ne bichoa ne khukhwaama bibiaamo. Sirakho sisina sitoro lundi kamasaafu ne ekhumaliilikha sikala siichakho ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.3.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoe. 3.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nio oli sialabile, ne omundu eecha mala akesa, sikila chindaalo che likesa cholile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lukano lwe khamiicho khatiiti nga khe kumupeeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu areeba ali, “Nono khunyala khwafwaananisia Bubwami bwa Wele nende siina? Lukano siina nilwo khunyala khwarumikhira khubwinoosia? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bubwami bwa Wele buli nga omundu owabukula khamiicho khatiiti khe kumupeeli mala abiaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyuma we siise sitiiti khachoa khekhola kumurongooro kumuboofu khukhila kikiindi kioosi. Kuraakho chisakia chimboofu mala chinyuni chombakhakho biswi mala chimenyakho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu elwachilanga babaandu narumikhira chingano chingali nga luno, ababoolela kamakali khuloondekhana ne limanya liabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeele se anyala abalomalomakho nakharumikhire chingano tawe, ne kakhali ne ali ne babeeka bewe, abenooselianga buli siindu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ayenjeesia embembeesi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oli ekolooba we ndaalo ng'eneyo, Yesu aboolela babeeka bewe ali, “Khekhwambukhe engelekha we nyanja.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako bakabukhana ne babaandu, babeeka bewe bengila mu liaaro nilio aba ne ekhalemo, ne barekukha ne naye. Kamaaro kakaandi kabao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oli basiili embembeesi eye kamaani yaucha, mala bibuli bie kameechi biarakikha khu khupa liliaaro, aramira atiiti kameechi kechulemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu aba enyuma we liliaaro alikho akona, etikiiye. Babeeka bamusiisimusia ne baloma bali, “Omwekisia, khaba se weendekheleelekho oli khunyala khwafwa tawe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu enyokha eema mala arafwira embembeesi ali, “Yakama! Lundi aboolela bibuli ali yenjeela embembeesi yakama mala enyanja yayenjeela.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yesu aboolela babeeka bewe ali, “Siina ne muriire? Se muli ne lisuubila tawe?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali baba ne buuri bukali mala bareebana bali, “Yuno naanu niye? Akhaba embembeesi ne bibuli bie kameechi bimuulila!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.4.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
